# 2026-09-27: final chain = Optuna stage-2 params (opt), bge-reranker-v2-m3 (cer -> teacher fin2 -> French self-training set fra),
#   French-adapted ceb (cef), bge-reranker-v2-m3 full recipe (cer2), Qwen3-Reranker-4B LoRA (ceq), fin5 = blend(stage 2 + ceb, stage 2 + cef;
#   both with cer2 + ceq), fin6 = fin5 models re-scoring unseen-country test pairs with French-adapted ceq (ceqf), then the output step
#   (final candidate set p1 >= 0.005, unseen-country shift fr=-2). GPU steps use the erbw env (torch 2.7.1+cu128 + peft).
opt   | cev cem ceb | sbatch --parsable -J fz_opt -t 06:00:00 --mem=48G --export=ALL,ER_WORK=/scratch/m25csa019/er_final,CMDS="src/tune.py tr=f_cand_tsim_ka extra=xf_tsim_ka+f2_tsim_ka+sib_tsim_ka+annf_tsim_ka+ctx_b1ka_train+cev_a1_train+sup_ka_tsim+cem_b1ka_train+ceb_b1ka_train sub=oof_b1ka:0.001 trials=30 frac=0.4 out=fin" jobs/multi.sbatch
